{
  "name": "layout-change-commands",
  "description": "The page runs five commands: a split of a card, a focus that leaves the layout as it was, a rename of a card that is no group, which fails, a rename of the group and a command that renames the group in a later step. Each command that changed the stored layout of the space is the event workbench.layout.change with its name, its parameters, its answer and the stored layout that it left, before its event workbench.command; the focus and the failed rename write none.",
  "replay": false,
  "reason": "The case runs the commands of the page workbench, and the Go producer runs no window (docs/spec/cases/page-wire/README.md#producer-runs).",
